  "body": "Offering space, comfort, and quality construction, this impressive family home is perfectly positioned in sought-after Bucklands Beach. Built with a combination of brick and weatherboard and featuring double glazing throughout, this home offers modern comfort with timeless appeal.\r\n\r\nDesigned with growing families in mind, the lower level features a spacious open-plan kitchen with a large island bench, flowing effortlessly into the dining area and out to the expansive sun-soaked deck—perfect for entertaining all year round. A separate lounge provides an additional living space, while a downstairs bedroom and bathroom offer excellent flexibility for guests, extended family, or those working from home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find a generous second living area, creating the perfect retreat for teenagers or a family media room. Four further bedrooms are positioned on this level, including the master bedroom with its own ensuite, while a well-appointed family bathroom and separate toilet comfortably service the remaining bedrooms.\r\n\r\nCompleting the package is a double internal access garage, excellent storage throughout, and an easy-care section in a premium family-friendly location close to top schools, beaches, parks, and local amenities.\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\n• Solid brick and weatherboard construction\r\n• Double glazing for year-round comfort\r\n• Five generous bedrooms\r\n• Three bathrooms, including downstairs guest bathroom\r\n• Spacious master bedroom with ensuite\r\n• Two separate living areas\r\n• Modern open-plan kitchen with large island\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a large entertaining deck\r\n• Close to Bucklands Beach, Half Moon Bay Marina, shops, parks\r\n• In zone for Macleans Primary, Howick Intermediate & Pakuranga College\r\n\r\n\r\nWhether you're accommodating a growing family, welcoming extended family, or simply looking for extra space to spread out, this beautifully presented home offers the flexibility and lifestyle you've been searching for.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this fantastic opportunity — contact Team Sandy today for more information.",
